Jargon conveys an agreed abbreviation, phonetic play, metaphor or special extended meaning. Evaluate the sentence's usage; familiar jargon still qualifies. “轮椅” for an accessible powerful strategy and “刮痧” for low damage qualify.
Personal aliases, official game or character names, ordinary words and standard technical abbreviations belong to other knowledge: set is_jargon false. Extra contextual details alone do not create a jargon meaning.
meaning briefly explains the supported sense and tone. Reassess earlier meanings using new evidence. If evidence establishes an ordinary word or proper name, set no_info false and is_jargon false. If usage cannot be determined, set no_info true. Identity, etymology and game mechanics require evidence.
